{
  "name": "SheetReach — Excel to WhatsApp campaign (n8n)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 · Get the contact file\nRun manually, or POST `{\"fileUrl\": \"https://…/contacts.xlsx\"}` to the webhook (e.g. from Google Drive, a form or a CRM export).\n\n**Edit `Settings` first** — in Docker use `http://host.docker.internal:8000`.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "04caae06-a89b-455c-adde-720466b6a682",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 · Clean, validate, protect\nSheetReach detects columns, normalises numbers, removes duplicates and checks opt-in + the Do Not Contact list. Only clean contacts are imported.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 1260,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "58cead94-6b2e-447e-84b3-ccf5f80568f7",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        580,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 · Personalise & send\nOne message, personalised per contact. Sent through SheetReach's WhatsApp provider: **Demo provider** by default (simulated, nothing leaves the app) or the official **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** when the client's credentials are configured.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "8114d955-552b-4d7d-82e5-586f5ff05ad0",
      "name": "Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        700
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 · Track & report\nPolls progress until the queue is done, downloads the Excel results and builds the final report.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 1220,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "7ae81109-41d0-4e5b-a53f-5167d3ce7253",
      "name": "Note 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        860,
        700
      ]
    },
    {
